# Background Customizer

Stack: Rust workspace, Tauri v2, Vite, React, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui.
Windows-first. Use React because the spec names shadcn/ui.

## Crate layout

- `crates/core` — config, profiles, monitor model (`serde`, `tokio`)
- `crates/renderer` — per-monitor GPU surface (`wgpu`). Do not implement rendering until that milestone.
- `crates/decoder` — image and video decode. Empty until that milestone.
- `crates/shell` — Tauri v2 app: tray, settings window, autostart, IPC
- `ui` — Vite + React + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui. Frontend package, not a Cargo crate.
- `crates/importer` — third-party wallpaper formats
- `crates/bench` — benchmark harness

Run `cargo tauri dev` from the repository root.

## Rules

- No `unwrap()` outside tests.
- All OS calls go behind traits.
- One milestone per commit.
- Keep unsafe Win32 in one module.
- Renderer release profile: `lto = "fat"`, `codegen-units = 1`, `panic = "abort"`, `opt-level = 3`.
